"Enter the code Henge shows. It also appears in a banner and a notification, so you don't have to switch back." = "输入 Henge 显示的配对码。它也会出现在横幅和通知里，不用切回来看。";
"Enter this code on your %@" = "在你的 %@ 上输入这串代码";
"Exporting %@ needs about %@ free; this %@ has %@. Deleting a downloaded macOS installer (Install macOS, swipe it) frees about 16 GB." = "导出 %@ 需要约 %@ 空闲空间，这台 %@ 只剩 %@。删除已下载的 macOS 安装包（在“安装 macOS”里左滑删除）可以释放约 16 GB。";
"For a Henge installed through TrollStore." = "适用于通过 TrollStore 安装的 Henge。";
"Get LocalDevVPN" = "获取 LocalDevVPN";
"HTTP \\(status), \\(data.count) bytes" = "HTTP \\(status)，\\(data.count) 字节";
"Henge couldn't create the download file." = "Henge 无法创建下载文件。";
