"Henge pairing code: \\(pin)" = "Henge 配对码：\\(pin)";
"Henge pretends to be a computer on your Wi-Fi, and your %@ pairs with it the way it would with a Mac." = "Henge 会在你的 Wi-Fi 上假装成一台电脑，你的 %@ 会像配对 Mac 那样与它配对。";
