"In TrollStore's Settings, turn on URL Scheme. TrollStore ignores enable-jit requests without it." = "在 TrollStore 的设置里打开 URL Scheme。没有它，TrollStore 会忽略 enable-jit 请求。";
"Install Henge.ipa through TrollStore, on an iOS version TrollStore supports. It carries the entitlements TrollStore keeps, so the same file works there and in a sideloader." = "在 TrollStore 支持的 iOS 版本上，用 TrollStore 安装 Henge.ipa。它带有 TrollStore 保留的权限，因此同一个文件在 TrollStore 和侧载工具里都能用。";
"Install [LocalDevVPN](%@) from the App Store." = "从 App Store 安装 [LocalDevVPN](%@)。";
"Install [StikDebug](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug/releases/latest)." = "安装 [StikDebug](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug/releases/latest)。";
