"LocalDevVPN can show Connected while iOS still sends Henge's connection over cellular. Turn Cellular Data off in Control Center, wait 2 seconds, then turn it back on. Or join any Wi-Fi once; a hotspot works. Keep LocalDevVPN connected, turn off other VPNs such as Tailscale, then try again." = "LocalDevVPN 显示已连接时，iOS 仍可能把 Henge 的连接走蜂窝数据。在控制中心关闭蜂窝数据，等 2 秒后再打开；或者连接任意一次 Wi-Fi（热点也行）。保持 LocalDevVPN 已连接，关闭 Tailscale 等其他 VPN，然后重试。";
"Low memory" = "低内存";
"Memory profile" = "内存档位";
"More than %lld GB is a lot for this %@: iOS may close Henge when macOS gets busy." = "对这台 %@ 来说，%lld GB 以上太多了：macOS 忙起来时 iOS 可能会关闭 Henge。";
"Needs iOS 27 or later." = "需要 iOS 27 或更高版本。";
