"On a device jailbroken with Dopamine, JIT is a setting: the jailbreak marks every app as debugged when it opens, and a debugged app may run code it wrote. Henge needs nothing else." = "在用 Dopamine 越狱的设备上，JIT 只是一个开关：越狱会在 App 打开时把它标记为已调试，而已调试的 App 可以运行自己写入的代码。Henge 不需要其他任何东西。";
"Once for each Mac: open Terminal on the Mac, tap this, then press Return. When macOS asks about henge-agent and local networks, choose Allow. It types %@ and needs the Mac's keyboard layout to be U.S." = "每台 Mac 只需做一次：在 Mac 上打开“终端”，点这个按钮，然后按回车。macOS 询问 henge-agent 和本地网络权限时选择“允许”。它会输入 %@，并且需要 Mac 的键盘布局为美式。";
"Open **Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode**, scroll down and tap **Pair with %@**." = "打开**设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式**，下滑并点按**与 %@ 配对**。";
