"StikDebug is a separate app that attaches to Henge. Henge sends it the JIT script itself, so nothing needs configuring for Henge inside StikDebug." = "StikDebug 是一个独立的 App，会挂接到 Henge。Henge 会自己把 JIT 脚本发给它，所以不需要在 StikDebug 里为 Henge 做任何配置。";
