"The device is short of memory, or this install's limit is under 3 GB: Henge picks a 512 MB code cache and a 30 Hz display by default, and caps the installer's temporary Mac at 2 GB. A 2 GB Mac is the most this device is likely to keep up. Choose a larger cache only if the Mac closes Henge mid-setup." = "设备内存紧张，或当前安装的上限低于 3 GB：Henge 默认选择 512 MB 代码缓存和 30 Hz 显示，并把安装用的临时 Mac 限制在 2 GB。2 GB 的 Mac 已经是这台设备能勉强跑动的上限。只有在安装过程中 Mac 把 Henge 关掉时，才考虑选更大的缓存。";
